---
import MiFoto from "../../assets/img/MiFoto.png";
---

<div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl px-6 text-gray-300">
  
  {/* Image Container with Circle Shape Wrapping */}
  <div 
    class="float-left mr-10 mb-6 bg-amber-100 border-primary h-64 w-64 md:h-96 md:w-96 rounded-full shadow-lg drop-shadow-[4px_4px_0_#7836cf] overflow-hidden"
    style="shape-outside: circle(50%);"
  >
    <img
      src={MiFoto.src}
      alt="Photo of Lautaro"
      class="h-full w-full object-cover"
    />
  </div>

  {/* Text Content */}
  <div class="text-justify leading-relaxed">
    {/* Main heading */}
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
      My 15-Year Journey in <span class="text-primary">Technology</span>
    </h2>

    {/* Intro paragraph */}
    <p class="mb-4">
      I didn’t begin my career simply wanting to write code. I began because I wanted to understand how software was reshaping the world. I’ve always believed that almost any idea can be built, improved, and scaled — if you’re willing to dig deep, learn continuously, and do the work.
    </p>

    {/* Philosophy */}
    <p class="font-semibold text-white mb-4">
      Technology isn’t magic. <br />
      It isn’t shortcuts. <br />
      It’s problem-solving, persistence, and practice.
    </p>

    {/* Experience overview */}
    <p class="mb-4">
      Over the past decade and a half, I’ve navigated the evolution of the web — from monolithic architectures to AI-driven, scalable ecosystems. My path hasn’t been linear, and that’s been my greatest strength.
    </p>

    {/* Roles */}
    <p class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">
      I’ve occupied almost every seat at the table:
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Full-stack engineer | AI systems builder | Engineering leader | Mentor and educator
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      Instead of choosing one lane, I leaned into all of them. I’ve built production-grade applications, delivered AI-focused systems optimized for performance and reliability, led engineering teams, refined development processes, and mentored aspiring developers.
    </p>

    {/* Key learning */}
    <p class="font-semibold text-white mb-4 italic">
      Along the way, I learned something critical: <br />
      Great software is built by empowered people — not just smart code.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      Early in my career, I thought I had to choose: Be a technical expert — or become a people leader. I eventually realized technology is a human endeavor. A system is only as good as the team that maintains it and the lives it improves. That realization became my edge. I don’t just deliver products — I build sustainable systems and empowered teams.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      When I’m not architecting systems or refining AI models, I actively contribute to the <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Pakistan IT ecosystem</span>. Through national training programs, I’ve helped hundreds of aspiring developers gain clarity, confidence, and a roadmap into the industry. Knowledge multiplies when it’s shared.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      Whether you're a founder or a developer, my mission is to make technology a force multiplier for your goals.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-3 mb-6 bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
      <p class="font-semibold text-white">If You Are… &nbsp; I Can Help You…</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Startup Founder</span> - Scale your product and build an inspired engineering team</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Aspiring Developer</span> - Break into the industry with clarity and confidence</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Technical Team</span> - Improve processes while keeping development human and meaningful</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="mb-4">
      I’m not a robot — even if I build them. I deal with bugs, deadlines, and learning curves like everyone else. My promise is transparency. I share both failures and wins so you can accelerate without repeating the same mistakes.
    </p>

    <p class="font-semibold text-white text-lg">
      The goal is simple: To make technology a force multiplier. Whether I’m automating complex workflows or guiding startups through scale, my goal remains the same: To leave the system, the code, and the people better than I found them.
    </p>
    
    <div class="clear-both"></div>
  </div>
</div>